# Generated Space directories produced by `make space` (common.mk's SPACE_DIR,
# default "space"), e.g. misc/byoc/skypilot/space/ or eval/eval-example/skypilot/space/. The source
# of truth is step-template.yaml + src/; the Space is derived. The dir name is a
# fixed literal, so ignore any `space/` at any depth under steps/.
**/space/
# The `steps` symlink `make space` adds to a custom test space (a
# test-data/<cluster>/ holding its own space.yaml), pointing at the generated
# ../../space/steps. See "Custom test spaces" in steps/README.md.
**/test-data/*/steps
